                                                                                   
                                                                                   
                                                                                   
                                                                                   
                                       TUI                                         
                                                                                   
                   The TUI is built around 3 navigable views.                      
                                                                                   
      ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐         
      │ 1  Issues             2  Worklogs           3  Synced            │         
      │                                                                  │         
      │ JIRA issues           Local worklogs        Worklogs synced      │         
      │ matching your JQL     not yet synced        to JIRA              │         
      └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘         
                                                                                   
                  j / k / ↑ / ↓     move through lists                             
                  1 / 2 / 3         switch views                                   
                  tab / shift+tab   cycle views                                    
                  ?                 open the full key reference                    
                                                                                   
                                                                                   
                                                                                   
                                                                                   
 punchout   3 / 6    h/← previous   space/l/→ next   esc/q quit   ] change theme   